<p:notes xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main" xmlns:r="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/relationships" xmlns:p="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/presentationml/2006/main"><p:cSld><p:spTree><p:nvGrpSpPr><p:cNvPr id="1" name=""/><p:cNvGrpSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvGrpSpPr><p:grpSpPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="0" y="0"/><a:ext cx="0" cy="0"/><a:chOff x="0" y="0"/><a:chExt cx="0" cy="0"/></a:xfrm></p:grpSpPr><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="2" name="Slide Image Placeholder 1"/><p:cNvSpPr><a:spLocks noGrp="1" noRot="1" noChangeAspect="1"/></p:cNvSpPr><p:nvPr><p:ph type="sldImg"/></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr/></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="3" name="Notes Placeholder 2"/><p:cNvSpPr><a:spLocks noGrp="1"/></p:cNvSpPr><p:nvPr><p:ph type="body" idx="1"/></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr/><p:txBody><a:bodyPr/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t>SOURCE KEY</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t>A: https://</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0" err="1"/><a:t>huggingface.co</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t>/Qwen/Qwen3-8B-GGUF/tree/main (chosen weight file and size).</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t>B: https://</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0" err="1"/><a:t>huggingface.co</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t>/Qwen/Qwen3-8B (original model card); https://</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0" err="1"/><a:t>huggingface.co</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t>/Qwen/Qwen3-8B/blob/main/</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0" err="1"/><a:t>config.json</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t> (architecture).</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t>Cache setting: assumed 16-bit values, 2 bytes each. This is independent of the chosen Q4_K_M weights.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t>All arithmetic results are calculated estimates, not measured peak memory.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:endParaRPr dirty="0"/></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t>DELIVERY</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t>Use after the Hugging Face screenshot. Click to reveal the calculations.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:endParaRPr dirty="0"/></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t>SPEAKER NARRATION</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t>Use this slide immediately after the user's Hugging Face screenshot. Read the repository name first: Qwen is the publisher, Qwen3 is the family, and 8B is a rounded parameter-count label. The original Qwen3-8B card reports 8.2 billion learned numerical values. Those values are the weights. This count does not say how many gigabytes the chosen representation requires. Next read the native context limit, 32,768 tokens, on the original model card. That budget includes both input and generated continuation, so a full 32K input leaves no room for a response within a 32K limit. An illustrative split is 24,576 input tokens and 8,192 output tokens. Finally inspect the selected file in the official GGUF repository. Q4_K_M is the roughly four-bit option in our example and its listed download size is 5.03 GB. Q8_0 is listed at 8.71 GB. These names describe alternative weight representations of the same underlying model. Choose one file, not all the variants. The 32 GB repository total is not this model's required memory. The original model card and GGUF Files tab are separate sources. Use the card for the model's characteristics and the file listing for the chosen artifact's actual size.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:endParaRPr dirty="0"/></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t>SOURCES</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t>https://</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0" err="1"/><a:t>huggingface.co</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t>/Qwen/Qwen3-8B</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t>https://</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0" err="1"/><a:t>huggingface.co</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr dirty="0"/><a:t>/Qwen/Qwen3-8B-GGUF/tree/main</a:t></a:r></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="4" name="Slide Number Placeholder 3"/><p:cNvSpPr><a:spLocks no